<title>PHILIPPINES: Grand Plaza sets 80 centavos cash div.</title>
<headline>Grand Plaza sets 80 centavos cash div.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines' Grand Plaza Hotel Corp said on Thursday its board of directors approved an 80 centavo per share cash dividend.</p>
<p>The company said in an advisory that the dividend will be paid to stockholders on record as of May 30, 1997.  </p>
<p>The cash dividend will be payable not later than June 29 this year, the company said.</p>
<p>Grand Plaza Hotel owns a deluxe hotel in the Philippines.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 8418939 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
